ss="pay-num pay-strong">23:28</td><td class="pay-flag"></td></tr><tr><td>Roe, Rick · RR02</td><td>Sun, Sep 13, 2026</td><td class="pay-num">16:33</td><td class="pay-num"></td><td class="pay-num pay-strong">16:33</td><td class="pay-flag"></td></tr><tr><td>Yu, Sam · SY03</td><td>Sun, Sep 13, 2026</td><td class="pay-num">42:00</td><td class="pay-num"></td><td class="pay-num pay-strong">42:00</td><td class="pay-flag">2h 0m over</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="pay-footnote">Overtime is flagged for the payroll operator, never computed as pay here.</div></section><section class="pay-employee"><div class="pay-employee-head"><span>Doe, Jane · JD01</span><span class="pay-num">23:28 paid</span></div><table class="pay-table pay-days"><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Clock in – clock out</th><th class="pay-num">Hours</th><th>Late</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="pay-date">Mon, Sep 14, 2026</td><td><div><div><div class="pay-stretch">08:29 AM<span class="pay-src"> (Import)</span> – 12:01 PM<span class="pay-src"> (Import)</span></div></div><div><div class="pay-break">30m break</div><div class="pay-stretch">12:31 PM<span class="pay-src"> (Import)</span> – 06:27 PM<span class="pay-src"> (Import)</span></div></div></div></td><td class="pay-num">09:28</td><td class="pay-flag">3m late</td><td class="pay-notes"></td></tr><tr><td class="pay-date">Wed, Sep 16, 2026</td><td><div><div><div class="pay-stretch">10:05 AM – 10:06 PM</div></div></div></td><td class="pay-num">12:01</td><td class="pay-flag"></td><td class="pay-notes">Edited · Covered the late chair</td></tr><tr><td class="pay-date">Thu, Sep 17, 2026</td><td><div><div><div class="pay-stretch">09:34 AM<span class="pay-src"> (GPS)</span> – <span class="pay-flag">no clock out</span></div></div></div></td><td class="pay-num">09:16</td><td class="pay-flag"></td><td class="pay-notes">MISSING PUNCH · Remote</td></tr><tr class="pay-adj"><td class="pay-date">Sat, Sep 19, 2026</td><td colSpan="1"><div class="pay-strong">Hours adjustment</div><div class="pay-adj-reason">Scheduled installment 2 of 2: remaining 7.28 hours of the 14.57 excess estimated hours paid for August 30–September 5.</div></td><td class="pay-num pay-strong">-7.28h</td><td></td><td class="pay-notes">Counts toward the hours paid this week</td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr><td colSpan="2" class="pay-foot-label">30:45 recorded −07:17 adjustments</td><td class="pay-num pay-strong">23:28</td><td colSpan="2"></td></tr></tfoot></table></section><section class="pay-employee"><div class="pay-employee-head"><span>Roe, Rick · RR02</span><span class="pay-num">16:33 paid</span></div><table class="pay-table pay-days"><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Clock in – clock out</th><th class="pay-num">Hours</th><th>Late</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="pay-date">Tue, Sep 15, 2026</td><td><div><div><div class="pay-stretch">09:40 AM – 02:19 PM</div></div><div><div class="pay-break">45m break</div><div class="pay-stretch">03:04 PM – 08:25 PM</div></div></div></td><td class="pay-num">10:00</td><td class="pay-flag"></td><td class="pay-notes"></td></tr><tr><td class="pay-date">Fri, Sep 18, 2026</td><td><div><div><div class="pay-stretch">08:08 AM – 02:41 PM</div></div></div></td><td class="pay-num">06:33</td><td class="pay-flag">29m late</td><td class="pay-notes">I assumed it was clocking</td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr><td colSpan="2" class="pay-foot-label">Total</td><td class="pay-num pay-strong">16:33</td><td colSpan="2"></td></tr></tfoot></table></section><section class="pay-sign"><div>Prepared by ______________________________ Date ____________</div><div>Reviewed by ______________________________ Date ____________</div></section><footer class="pay-page-footer">Northfield Dental Group, LLC · Weekly Timesheet · Sun, Sep 13, 2026 – Sat, Sep 19, 2026 · Payroll record</footer></div>"`;
